{"id": "0x0205", "plain_text": "Be quiet!\n--- PAGE ---\nIt's only !\nI, Damp the gravekeeper, am\nin bed now!\n--- PAGE ---\nGo away and play! Maybe you can\nfind a ghost in the daytime?", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "TIME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0206", "plain_text": "It's  now.\nThe Gravedigging Tour is over \nnow!\n--- PAGE ---\nI, Damp the gravekeeper, am\nin bed!\n--- PAGE ---\nGo away and play! Maybe you'll\nfind a ghost!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["TIME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0207", "plain_text": "Happy Mask Shop\nPlease read this sign before you\nuse this shop.\n--- PAGE ---\nHow This Shop Works\nWe do not sell masks at this shop.\nWe just lend them to you.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou sell the loaned masks on your\nown.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou pay back the money for the\nmask, and we will lend you a \nnewer model.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou can borrow masks you have\nalready sold again; however, you \ncan sell each model of mask only\nonce.\n--- PAGE ---\nPlease try our shop!\n--Happy Mask Shop Owner", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "SHIFT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0208", "plain_text": "Shadow Temple...\nHere is gathered Hyrule's bloody \nhistory of greed and hatred...", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0209", "plain_text": "What is hidden in the darkness...\nTricks full of ill will...\nYou can't see the way forward...", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x020A", "plain_text": "One who gains the eye of truth\nwill be able to see what is hidden\nin the darkness.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x020B", "plain_text": "Something strange is covering the\nentrance. You must solve the\npuzzle in this room to make the\nentrance open.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x020C", "plain_text": "Giant dead Dodongo...\nwhen it sees red,\na new way to go \nwill be open.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
