{"id": "0x0217", "plain_text": "If you wish to speak to me,\ndo so from the platform.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0218", "plain_text": "Hi, [PLAYER]!\nLook this way!\n--- PAGE ---\nLook over here with [C-Left], and talk \nto me with [A].", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["UNSKIPPABLE", "SFX", "QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NAME", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "NEWLINE", "BOX_BREAK", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": ["C-Left", "A"], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0219", "plain_text": "The current time is: .", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "TIME", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x021A", "plain_text": "Shine light on the living dead...", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x021B", "plain_text": "Those who break into the Royal \nTomb will be obstructed by the\nlurkers in the dark.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x021C", "plain_text": "Hey, you! Young man, over there!\nLook over here, inside the cell!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x021D", "plain_text": "My little boy isn't here right \nnow...\nI think he went to play in the \ngraveyard...", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x021E", "plain_text": "Oh, my boy is asleep right now.\nPlease come back some other time\nto play with him!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["NEWLINE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x021F", "plain_text": "When water fills the lake, \nshoot for the morning light.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0220", "plain_text": "If you want to travel to the \nfuture, you should return here \nwith the power of silver from the \npast.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0221", "plain_text": "If you want to proceed to the \npast, you should return here\nwith the pure heart of a child.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0222", "plain_text": "This door is currently being\nrefurbished.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0223", "plain_text": "It looks like something used to\nbe set in this stand...", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0224", "plain_text": "Make my beak face the\nskull of truth.\n--- PAGE ---\nThe alternative is descent into\nthe deep darkness.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "NEWLINE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "EVENT", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
