{"id": "0x0226", "plain_text": "Granny's Potion Shop\nClosed\n--- PAGE ---\nGone for Field Study\nPlease come again!\n--Granny", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0227", "plain_text": "Who's there? What a bad kid,\ntrying to enter from the rear\ndoor!\n--- PAGE ---\nSuch a bad kid...\nI have to tell you some juicy\ngossip!\n--- PAGE ---\nThe boss carpenter has a son...\nHe's the guy who sits under the\ntree every night...\n--- PAGE ---\nDon't tell the boss I told you \nthat!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "TEXT_SPEED", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x0228", "plain_text": "Look at this!", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_68)", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
