{"id": "0x022A", "plain_text": "[PLAYER]'s Records!\nSpiders squished: Largest fish caught:  pounds\n--- PAGE ---\nMarathon time: \nHorse race time: \nHorseback archery:  points", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_65)", "NAME", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "TOKENS", "HIGHSCORE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
