{"id": "0x022C", "plain_text": "R.I.P.\nHere lie the souls of those who\nswore fealty to the\nRoyal Family of Hyrule\n--- PAGE ---\nThe Sheikah, guardians of the\nRoyal Family and founders of\nKakariko, watch over these spirits\nin their eternal slumber.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "NEWLINE", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "BOX_BREAK", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
{"id": "0x022D", "plain_text": "Sleepless Waterfall\nThe flow of this waterfall serves\nthe King of Hyrule. When the King\nslumbers, so too do these falls.", "category": "SIGN", "control_codes": ["QUICKTEXT_ENABLE", "SHIFT", "COLOR", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_67)", "NEWLINE", "COLOR(UNKNOWN_64)", "QUICKTEXT_DISABLE", "END"], "variables": [], "button_glyphs": [], "choices": []}
